r-core-left-align\">\n                                                    <div class=\"gdlr-core-image-item-wrap gdlr-core-media-image  gdlr-core-image-item-style-rectangle\" style=\"border-width: 0px;\"><img src=\"/upload/hp1-service-icon.png\" alt=\"Our Journey icon\" width=\"44\" height=\"35\"  loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n                                                </div>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-element\">\n                                                <div class=\"gdlr-core-title-item gdlr-core-item-pdb clearfix  gdlr-core-left-align gdlr-core-title-item-caption-bottom gdlr-core-item-pdlr\" style=\"padding-bottom: 25px;\">\n                                                    <div class=\"gdlr-core-title-item-title-wrap \">\n                                                        <h2 class=\"gdlr-core-title-item-title gdlr-core-skin-title \" style=\"font-size: 50px;letter-spacing: 0px;text-transform: none;\">Our Journey<span class=\"gdlr-core-title-item-title-divider gdlr-core-skin-divider\" ></span></h2></div>  </div>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-element\">\n                                                <div class=\"gdlr-core-divider-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-divider-item-normal\">\n                                                    <div class=\"gdlr-core-divider-container gdlr-core-left-align\" style=\"max-width: 20px;\">\n                                                        <div class=\"gdlr-core-divider-line gdlr-core-skin-divider\" style=\"border-color: #282828;\"></div>\n                                                    </div>\n                                                </div>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-element\">\n                                                <div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align\" style=\"padding-bottom: 15px;\">\n                                                    <div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item-content\" style=\"font-size: 17px;\">\n                                                        <p>Established in 2001, M.M. Knitwear is one of the top knitwear manufacturers based in Bangladesh, specialising in organic cotton and fast fashion knitwear for global brands, independent boutiques and specialist retailers. As one of the country's leading clothing manufacturers, we produce garments of the highest quality and offer a full-scale manufacturing solution built around our buyers' specifications.</p>\n                                                        <p>Our fully integrated knit composite facility in Gazipur produces 200,000 garments per day across more than 15,23,000 square feet of factory space, supported by a workforce of over 10,982 people. Every stage of production - yarn and fabric dyeing, circular knitting, cutting, sewing, finishing, printing, AOP and embroidery - is managed in-house to protect quality, lead time and compliance.</p>\n                                                        <p>We supply knitted apparel including men's t-shirts and pants, women's tops and dresses, and kids' hoodies and sweaters to leading international brands such as Zara, Pepe Jeans, OVS, Terranova, Springfield, Ulla Popken, Crew Clothing, Sfera, Auchan and New Yorker. Our factories are ACCORD, OEKO-TEX, AMFORI BSCI, WRAP and SEDEX certified, with ISO and OHSAS management systems in place.</p>\n                                                    </div>\n                                                </div>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-element\">\n                                                <div class=\"gdlr-core-butt